List all the reqlang files reqlang-web has.

```%request
GET {{@clientUrl}}/api/files HTTP/1.1
```

```%response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json

["requests/api_debug.reqlang","requests/api_file.reqlang","requests/api_files.reqlang","requests/api_run_history.reqlang","requests/status_code.reqlang"]
```